type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in 4.7.dev [0b3dc97].\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.dev - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9174) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-12700H (20 threads) - 15.69 GiB memoryGodot v4.6.stable - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9174) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-12700H (20 threads) - 15.69 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nI found several issues related to this recent PR:\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112985\n\n1. When right-clicking a scene root node, \"Paste as Replacement Alt+V\" is greyed out in the context menu, but inputting the Alt+V shortcut still performs the action (select the root node with left click first).\n\n2. (1) replaces the root node successfully, but also deletes the first child node (and its grandchild nodes) as an unexpected side effect.\n\n3. Undoing (1) with Ctrl+Z only brings back the deleted child node, but not its grandchild nodes (permanently deleted).\n\n4. After (3), any new grandchild node cannot have the same name as the unexpectedly deleted grandchild nodes, even though the deleted nodes are not saved to the tscn file. This is fixed after reloading the project.\n\n5. The inherited scene root node is missing the \"Paste as Replacement Alt+V\" button in the context menu.\n\nNote:\n- For (1), I think \"Paste as Replacement Alt+V\" should not be greyed out, since it does make sense to replace the root node with another node, similar to \"Make scene root\".\n\n\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nAs stated above. Video:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/34356899-b2b3-40e3-8c0e-95813410f7f4\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[MRP_Paste_As_Replacement.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26865292/MRP_Paste_As_Replacement.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118741/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118741/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}